{"id": 316, "forum": "3-fontany", "title": "Фонтан в КД Октавия", "posts": [{"id": 2144, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2021-06-09", "html": "<p>Компания &quot;Гидрология&quot; ведёт работы по строительству фонтана в КД Октавия.</p><p>Проект фонтана разработан на основе технологии БКВ</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_ba4404c29e3ff4f6263c2942362c7006", "thumb": "", "name": "Okt.font.2021.001.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_037a65eebb70034fc489edc504582256", "thumb": "", "name": "Okt.font.2021.002.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_e008c528caf34df76a4190e2ad83e930", "thumb": "", "name": "Okt.font.2021.003.jpg"}]}, {"id": 2145, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2021-06-09", "html": "<p>Чаша подготовлена. Производится монтаж оборудования</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_ccdfa6ce8b7a81f1342ea71e69ac64c6", "thumb": "", "name": "Okt.font.2021.004.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_e1b2bea482af1aff71dafe2daad4fab9", "thumb": "", "name": "Okt.font.2021.005.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_9972e4db830bd3f90fdff356c6e606aa", "thumb": "", "name": "Okt.font.2021.006.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_bda76331f379fabfd0a0d24c18ca1d01", "thumb": "", "name": "Okt.font.2021.007.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_b00a7480135caea99ec35ed264e04a05", "thumb": "", "name": "Okt.font.2021.008.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_be097497306bb8aaf1887f25955a3bf5", "thumb": "", "name": "Okt.font.2021.009.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_96634b2495ec32bd0908274694514b5f", "thumb": "", "name": "Okt.font.2021.010.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_0a8dcff2ea0683aebb2654e527113ddd", "thumb": "", "name": "Okt.font.2021.011.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_995e829ddea3763a80305e6c79809f31", "thumb": "", "name": "Okt.font.2021.012.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_e9acc25c0738c97bb8fdbf0070a026c8", "thumb": "", "name": "Okt.font.2021.013.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_6a846541a322e03c5d26d289196a4677", "thumb": "", "name": "Okt.font.2021.014.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_33fbee61eb4e9d0b4c720c3